WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.933
Year gives your bigger intentions somewhere to
live. Imagine you want

00:00:03.933 --> 00:00:07.615
more time outdoors, a calmer home, and to stay
close to

00:00:07.615 --> 00:00:07.950
family.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:12.750
More time outdoors is one direction. You can
add detail later.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:17.390
A calmer home joins the list. You decide what
that means

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:18.950
in your own life.

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:24.300
Stay close to family sits alongside it. These
are your intentions.

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:28.580
Here is how goals can nest. A calmer home
might lead

00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:32.510
to a usable spare room this quarter, then a
clear floor

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:36.441
this month. Sorting one box becomes a weekly
activity, given attention

00:00:36.441 --> 00:00:40.371
today. The bigger goals stay in place. You
choose the connections,

00:00:40.371 --> 00:00:41.800
and can start anywhere.
